# Copy to .env (factory init creates an empty one). .env is gitignored; never commit it.
#
# Personal profile: Pi runs through the pi-claude-subscription provider, which drives the Claude Code CLI.
# On the host, log in with `claude auth login` and install the provider (see orchestrator/ADAPTING.md).
# No Pi login or API key is used for this provider.
# Inside the container the Claude Code CLI authenticates with a Claude Code token: run
# `claude setup-token` on the host and paste the result here (leave empty until then).
CLAUDE_CODE_OAUTH_TOKEN=
